2	// external prebuilt vsim build, mirroring $QEMU_BIN_DIR), and -- when the env is
3	// unset -- from the VSIM_BIN_DIR assignment in config.env, so `./andesim` finds
4	// the external vsim without a prior `source ./setup.sh`. Pure environment/file
5	// logic, no subprocess.
